## What it is

An open-world Western adventure following Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde gang.

## Is this your kind of game?

This is a choice for readers interested in a character-led Western and an open world to explore. Look at the pacing of travel and ordinary activities as well as action scenes when deciding whether it fits your interests.

## Download and purchase

This is a paid game. Check the official store for current regional pricing, editions, and purchase terms. Use the official Steam button on this page to open the publisher's listing. Installation is handled by Steam; GameNews does not host installers or game files.

Confirm the exact product title and edition on the store. Review its current account, launcher, and hardware requirements before purchasing or installing.

## Before installing

Compare your operating system, processor, memory, graphics support, and available storage with the complete current requirements. A minimum specification is not a promise of a particular frame rate on your computer. Leave room for updates and check any additional account requirements before downloading.

## Sources and editorial basis

Product information checked against the [official Steam listing](https://store.steampowered.com/app/1174180/?l=english) on 16 October 2026. Selected with reference to [Steam's most-played chart](https://store.steampowered.com/charts/mostplayed/). This is a researched profile, not a hands-on review or a search-volume ranking. Live prices, player counts, and performance scores are intentionally not quoted.
